UP052 [*] Use `Generator` instead of `Iterator` for a context manager
  --> UP052.py:11:17
   |
10 | @contextmanager
11 | def simple() -> Iterator[int]:
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
12 |     yield 1
   |
help: Replace with `Generator`
   |
10 | @contextmanager
   - def simple() -> Iterator[int]:
11 + def simple() -> t.Generator[int, None, None]:
12 |     yield 1
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

